{"id":"n59494-2-6","stage":3,"title":"날아오다 · 飞过来","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59494-2-6-1","ko":"너 얼굴에 왜 멍이 들었어?","zh":"你脸上怎么有淤青啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"얼굴에","meaning":"脸，面孔，脸部","explanation":"얼굴：脸，面孔，脸部；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴에","audio":"/audio/9ac369fc067ad882131a.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"멍이","meaning":"青块，淤青","explanation":"멍：青块，淤青；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"멍","audio":"/audio/bd9899a4316fe5ab25a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54990","senseId":"1","lemma":"멍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멍이","audio":"/audio/8863c1601c960506c896.mp3"}},{"text":"들었어?","meaning":"进入，陷入","explanation":"들다：进入，陷入；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"10","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들었어","audio":"/audio/212b440366b02768c97f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"脸，面孔，脸部","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"有眼睛、鼻子、嘴的头的前面部分。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"bd9899a4316fe5ab","term":"멍","zh":"青块，淤青","audio":"/audio/bd9899a4316fe5ab25a2.mp3","entryId":"54990","definition":"由于挨碰或挨打，皮下出现淤血的现象。","pronunciation":["멍"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"进入，陷入","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"处于某种处境或变成某种状态。","pronunciation":["들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c7559e5aba3bbec4aec5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59494-2-6-2","ko":"아, 어제 민준이한테 화를 좀 냈더니 바로 주먹이 날아오더라고.","zh":"啊，昨天我生敏俊的气，他马上就挥拳打过来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"咦","explanation":"아：咦","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"1","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"민준이한테","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"민준이한테","audio":"/audio/61ffa7b81d49a5485c64.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이한테","audio":"/audio/61ffa7b81d49a5485c64.mp3"}},{"text":"화를","meaning":"火，气","explanation":"화：火，气；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"화","audio":"/audio/950afe85bf406364ecdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74134","senseId":"1","lemma":"화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화를","audio":"/audio/796488caaf79e93bb6ec.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","e